@Component
@RequiredArgsConstructor
public class JsonAuthenticationHandlers {

    private final ObjectMapper objectMapper;

    public AuthenticationSuccessHandler success() {
        return (request, response, authentication) -> {
            response.setStatus(HttpServletResponse.SC_OK);
            response.setContentType(MediaType.APPLICATION_JSON_VALUE);
            objectMapper.writeValue(response.getWriter(),
                    MemberResponse.from(authentication));
        };
    }

    public AuthenticationFailureHandler failure() {
        return (request, response, exception) -> write(request, response,
                HttpStatus.UNAUTHORIZED, code(exception));
    }

    public LogoutSuccessHandler logout() {
        return (request, response, authentication) -> {
            response.setStatus(HttpServletResponse.SC_NO_CONTENT);
        };
    }
}
```

> **성공은 200 + 사용자 정보, 실패는 401 + 문제 상세, 로그아웃은 204** 다.
